%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Events_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0f9addddcd3975348b4e5b7436143f0d, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 944534712320
    m_Localized: Move on
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944568266752
    m_Localized: Nothing happened.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461056
    m_Localized: Fallen Tree
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461057
    m_Localized: A thick tree blocks the road. The path is too narrow to go around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461058
    m_Localized: Push through
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461059
    m_Localized: You shoved the tree aside. The bumper got scraped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461060
    m_Localized: The tree crashed onto the hull. Everyone was thrown around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461061
    m_Localized: Burn fuel to detour
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461062
    m_Localized: You took the long way around, unharmed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461063
    m_Localized: Wandering Trader
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461064
    m_Localized: A trader with a loaded cart waves from the roadside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461065
    m_Localized: Trade food for fuel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461066
    m_Localized: The trader handed over fuel cans with a nod.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461067
    m_Localized: Decline
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461068
    m_Localized: The trader shrugged and pulled his cart on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461069
    m_Localized: Zombie Raid
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461070
    m_Localized: Zombies pour onto the road from both sides.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461071
    m_Localized: Fight back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461072
    m_Localized: You cleared them out, barely. Everyone is wounded.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461073
    m_Localized: You were overrun. Even the hull took a beating.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461074
    m_Localized: Floor it and flee
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461075
    m_Localized: You outran the horde.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461076
    m_Localized: A few latched onto the car as you fled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461077
    m_Localized: A Quiet Day
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461078
    m_Localized: Nothing happened today. Only the wind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461079
    m_Localized: Tinker with the car
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461080
    m_Localized: You tightened loose bolts. The engine runs better.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461081
    m_Localized: Just rest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461082
    m_Localized: Nothing happened. That was the greatest luxury.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461083
    m_Localized: Abandoned Gas Station
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461084
    m_Localized: A few pumps still stand under a rusted sign. Tire tracks crisscross
      the lot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461085
    m_Localized: Open the underground tank
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461086
    m_Localized: You scooped what pooled at the bottom into cans.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461087
    m_Localized: Something lunged out from under the lid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461088
    m_Localized: Raid only the store's fridge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461089
    m_Localized: One lukewarm bottle was left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461090
    m_Localized: Dry Well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461091
    m_Localized: An old well stands in the middle of a dead village. The pulley still
      turns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461092
    m_Localized: Lower the rope and draw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461093
    m_Localized: There was still water down deep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461094
    m_Localized: The rope snapped and tore up a hand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461095
    m_Localized: Boil and filter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461096
    m_Localized: Not clear, but drinkable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461097
    m_Localized: Something got past the filter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461098
    m_Localized: Ruined Farm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461099
    m_Localized: A garden still grows green beside a collapsed barn. No owner in
      sight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461100
    m_Localized: Search the storehouse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461101
    m_Localized: A crate of cans behind the wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461102
    m_Localized: You disturbed a hive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461103
    m_Localized: Check only the garden
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461104
    m_Localized: A few unripe vegetables.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461105
    m_Localized: Follow the clucking
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461106
    m_Localized: The eggs were still warm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461107
    m_Localized: Startled hens leapt onto the windshield.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461108
    m_Localized: Vending Machine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461109
    m_Localized: A vending machine glows in the middle of the road, the only light
      left in the world. 'Cheering for your delicious tomorrow.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461110
    m_Localized: Kick it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461111
    m_Localized: Thunk. Everything dropped. Tomorrow tastes good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461112
    m_Localized: It toppled onto a foot. The slogan stayed cheerful.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461113
    m_Localized: Haul it onto the car
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461114
    m_Localized: Still lit in the trunk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461115
    m_Localized: The suspension screamed under the weight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461116
    m_Localized: Positivity Broadcast
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461117
    m_Localized: The static clears into a bright voice. 'Did you survive today, everyone?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461118
    m_Localized: Listen to the end
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461119
    m_Localized: Oddly uplifting. It ended with a water purifier ad.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461120
    m_Localized: You snacked along and ate an emergency ration.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461121
    m_Localized: Fiddle with the dial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461122
    m_Localized: Caught a distress broadcast. There were fuel cans at the spot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461123
    m_Localized: The antenna snapped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461124
    m_Localized: Switch it off
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461125
    m_Localized: Abandoned Clinic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944572461126
    m_Localized: A building with a half-faded cross. The door is open; inside is
      quiet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655360
    m_Localized: Search the supply room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655361
    m_Localized: Bandages and antibiotics remained.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655362
    m_Localized: The pills were long expired.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655363
    m_Localized: Rest a night in a bed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655364
    m_Localized: First real sleep in ages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655365
    m_Localized: Scrapyard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655366
    m_Localized: Cars stacked like hills. Maybe some parts are still good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655367
    m_Localized: Strip parts
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655368
    m_Localized: Found a part that fits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655369
    m_Localized: Sliced a hand on rusted sheet metal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655370
    m_Localized: Burn fuel for a tune-up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655371
    m_Localized: The engine sounds smoother.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655372
    m_Localized: Should have left it alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655373
    m_Localized: Campfire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655374
    m_Localized: The night air bites. Dry branches litter the roadside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655375
    m_Localized: Light a fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655376
    m_Localized: Warmth settled into tired bodies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655377
    m_Localized: Something approached the smoke. You doused it fast.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655378
    m_Localized: Tough it out without fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655379
    m_Localized: Cold, but you held.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655380
    m_Localized: The cold got in deep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655381
    m_Localized: Highwaymen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655382
    m_Localized: Gun barrels rise from behind a truck blocking the road. 'Hand it
      all over.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655383
    m_Localized: Ram through
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655384
    m_Localized: Bullets scraped the hull, but you broke through.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655385
    m_Localized: Tires and glass hit. Everyone's hurt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655386
    m_Localized: Hand over food
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655387
    m_Localized: They stepped aside in silence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655388
    m_Localized: Torch a fuel trail
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655389
    m_Localized: Flames split the road; you slipped through.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655390
    m_Localized: The fire licked back at the car.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655391
    m_Localized: Sandstorm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655392
    m_Localized: The horizon rises brown. It's coming fast.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655393
    m_Localized: Drive straight through
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655394
    m_Localized: Sand scoured the paint, but you passed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655395
    m_Localized: Blind, you slammed into a ditch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655396
    m_Localized: Park and wait it out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655397
    m_Localized: The wind died after two hours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655398
    m_Localized: Burn fuel to detour
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655399
    m_Localized: Long way, but safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655400
    m_Localized: The detour was rougher.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655401
    m_Localized: Eternal Traffic Jam
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655402
    m_Localized: Hundreds of cars sit still. The skeleton in the lead car still has
      its blinker on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655403
    m_Localized: Push cars aside one by one
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655404
    m_Localized: A picnic lunch in a trunk. Nobody asked about the date.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655405
    m_Localized: The last car didn't go quietly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655406
    m_Localized: Take the shoulder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655407
    m_Localized: The blinker yielded to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655408
    m_Localized: A flat. The shoulder wasn't a shoulder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655409
    m_Localized: Rifle through the cars
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655410
    m_Localized: Snacks everyone left behind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655411
    m_Localized: Something in the trunk was awake.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655412
    m_Localized: The Great Migration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655413
    m_Localized: It takes seconds to realize the thing blanketing the horizon is
      not people.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655414
    m_Localized: Floor it and break through
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655415
    m_Localized: You stopped counting the impacts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655416
    m_Localized: The car was lifted and dropped again and again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655417
    m_Localized: Stop and hold your breath
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655418
    m_Localized: The mass passed, eventually.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655419
    m_Localized: A window broke.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655420
    m_Localized: Light a fuel can and throw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655421
    m_Localized: Flames turned them aside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655422
    m_Localized: Sparks fell on the roof.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655423
    m_Localized: Brace where you are
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655424
    m_Localized: The hull crumpled and everyone curled into a corner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655425
    m_Localized: All that remained in their wake was a half-wrecked car.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655426
    m_Localized: Knock at Midnight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655427
    m_Localized: Two a.m. Three polite knocks on the car door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655428
    m_Localized: Open the door
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655429
    m_Localized: A traveler shared supplies and left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655430
    m_Localized: It wasn't a person at the door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655431
    m_Localized: Ask its name
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655432
    m_Localized: The knocking stopped. Footsteps faded.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655433
    m_Localized: No answer, only the glass rattling.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655434
    m_Localized: Start the engine to scare it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655435
    m_Localized: The shadow backed off from the engine noise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655436
    m_Localized: Stranded Stranger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655437
    m_Localized: A man at the roadside with both hands raised. 'Just a sip of water.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655438
    m_Localized: Share water
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655439
    m_Localized: He produced a hidden stash and bowed his head.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655440
    m_Localized: Thanks was said; a ration vanished.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655441
    m_Localized: Refuse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655442
    m_Localized: You watched him shrink in the mirror.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655443
    m_Localized: Take what he has
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655444
    m_Localized: He didn't resist. Nobody spoke.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 944576655445
    m_Localized: He was not alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
